# Capacitor live-reload helper. Machine-specific (LAN IP + dev-server URL) and
# never part of a build — see docs/ENGINEERING_EXECUTION_SPEC.md Phase 5.
# Gradle/build outputs under android/ are NOT listed here: Capacitor generates
# android/.gitignore with the platform and it already covers them.
scripts/capacitor.live-reload.mjs

# Local scratch at the repo root: probe outputs, dev-server launchers and review
# screenshots. Machine-specific or regenerable, never part of a build. Kept on
# disk (several are evidence) but kept out of `git status`, so the
# tree-stays-clean assertion in .github/workflows/ci.yml is verifiable on this
# machine and not only on the runner. `probe-gate.json` is deliberately NOT
# listed — it is committed evidence produced by tools/probe-gate.mjs via
# run-probe.cmd, and an ignore rule would not apply to a tracked path anyway.
/.workbuddy-ai/
/t.txt
/probe-a.json
/run-probe.cmd
/run-vite.cmd
/phase2-00-app.png
/phase2-live.png

